\subsection{Vector arguments and recycling}{

All arguments support vectorization to create scenarios with different
parameter values:
\itemize{
\item \strong{Length 1}: The value is recycled (applied to all scenarios).
\item \strong{Length > 1}: All vector arguments must have the same length, which
determines the number of scenarios.
\item \strong{Mixed lengths}: An error is thrown if vector arguments have
inconsistent lengths.
